WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.822 --> 00:00:10.715
Bag maker 1: the order of Zlatibor Mlekara d.o.o., 30,108 of 49,000 bags made.

2
00:00:11.335 --> 00:00:43.164
The run's last cartons come off the line, each one counted and weighed.

3
00:00:43.802 --> 00:00:58.227
The last carton: 4,000 bags, 36 kg from the scale, from the reel on the unwinder.

4
00:00:58.851 --> 00:01:08.109
He finishes the job: 50,108 of 49,000 bags, within the 10 % the customer accepts.

5
00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:16.362
On the board the order is ready.

6
00:01:17.831 --> 00:01:25.075
Zlatibor Mlekara d.o.o. had the ready notice the same minute, in their own language.
